  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 medium head cabbage, sliced",
    "3 slices bacon, diced",
    "1 onion, thinly sliced",
    "1 cup cubed cooked ham",
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "3 cups potatoes - baked, cooled and thinly sliced",
    "0.5 teaspoon paprika",
    "salt and pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jupUNCQPrjM0G0yJmIb382OBN2E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-18854-bubble-n-squeak-VAT-step-01-49f7e1fbe0ad4a30adc1a7153ca1a490.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18854/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook cabbage in a medium saucepan with a small amount of water until tender, about 3 to 5 minutes. Drain, and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ygs2L3x4P0BPJzn2AFJtJcvFbg4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-18854-bubble-n-squeak-VAT-step-02-14201e79121e4d8daa49dfc1e544ab26.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18854/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook bacon and onion in a well-seasoned cast iron skillet until onion is soft and bacon is cooked, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SiM0TtuZHtnbzR_NT-Z8ADetmHM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-18854-bubble-n-squeak-VAT-step-03-5bb7daac7648456f95d7958562a7d2da.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18854/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add ham, and cook until heated through. Add butter, then mix in cooked cabbage and potatoes; season with paprika, salt, and pepper. Cook until browned on the bottom, turn, and brown again.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H4uatGY1Xw_myUSJUJ_Qa3SMr4o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-18854-bubble-n-squeak-VAT-step-04-ae9ae6fd23684af080df88ad04afc095.jpg"
